@title 3D view: a maker model that came lying down is turned and the turn is kept
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# `library` puts a synthetic STEP model for K1's part (Siemens 3RT2016-1AP01) in the profile. K1 (612,392) is where the default angled view puts it at 1366x768, so the pins on top of the model show; F zooms to the selected device.
library qa/fixtures/library
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
click 612 392
wait 40
key f
wait 300
expect "Maker model"
shot model-as-it-came
click_text Roll
wait 300
expect "Turned about width 0°, height 0°, depth 90°"
shot model-rolled
click_text Reset
wait 300
expect_not "Turned about width"
shot model-reset
check_layout
